{% comment %} 
                                                                            KIKO Cosmetics Megamenu
                                                                            A megamenu section matching the KIKO Cosmetics store design with: 
                                                                            - Click-to-open dropdowns (not hover) 
                                                                            - Full-width dropdown with white/light background 
                                                                            - "View all [Category]" button at top left 
                                                                            - X close button at top right 
                                                                            - Left sidebar with category links 
                                                                            - Multiple product columns in the middle 
                                                                            - Collections section at bottom with circular images 
                                                                            - Different dropdown layouts for different menu items 
{% endcomment %}

